        {
          "lesson": "Exclude amount fields (billed_amount, allowed_amount, paid_amount, member_oop, cob_amount), pre-computed outcome flags (high_cost_flag), and identifiers (claim_id, member_id) from features in any predictive model. These directly reveal or are derived from the target.",
